        <key>anchorPolicy</key>
        <string>These are deliberately designed new functional coordinates for top, bottom, side, ogonek and middle mark roles. The original native zero coordinates are not treated as inactive. Side and middle are separate semantic roles, not a broad y-coordinate filter.</string>
        <key>construction</key>
        <string>Place twelve actual same-cut native period drawings around the o round-height frame. Reduce only the dot components optically, retaining their genuine weight and italic contours. Preserve native o edge-spacing roles. No capital, whole letter or upright is scaled into a small cap or synthetic italic.</string>
